---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../styles/aboutus.css';
---
<Layout>

<section class="hero-welcome-section" style="padding: 60px 0; overflow-x: hidden;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row align-items-center">

      <div class="col-lg-5 col-md-12">
        <div class="hero-content">
          <h1 class="hero-title">WELCOME TO <span>NAIVAIDYA,</span></h1>
          <h2 class="hero-subtitle">Where Health Feels Like <span>Home.</span></h2>
          
          <p class="hero-description">
            At Naivaidya, we combine compassionate, personalized care with clinical expertise 
            to help you move better, recover faster, and live pain-free. From physiotherapy, 
            women's health, and geriatric support to integrated services like consultations,
            <span id="moreText" style="display: none;">
              pathology, digital X-ray, ECG, sonography, 2D echo, stress tests, and PFTs, 
              we ensure accurate diagnosis and effective treatment. Our facility also offers 
              IV infusion therapy, day care procedures, vaccinations, drugless therapies, 
              and personalized diet and nutrition plans all under one roof. Built on trust, 
              empathy, and excellence, Naivaidya delivers holistic healthcare where health 
              truly feels like home.
            </span>
          </p>

          <div class="hero-buttons">
            <button id="readMoreBtn" class="theme-btn btn-dark">READ MORE</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-lg-7 col-md-12 order-first order-lg-last">
        <div class="hero-image-container">
          <img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/daoju0r3c/image/upload/v1755375991/WhatsApp_Image_2025-07-24_at_15.23.21_1_tphyoj.jpg" 
               alt="Naivaidya Healthcare Team" class="hero-image"/>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="department_listing">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-lg-12">
          <div class="department_list_inner">
            <div class="image">
              <img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/daoju0r3c/image/upload/v1755686377/image_11_2_g81seb.png" class="img-fluid" alt="Dr. Saurabh Jain" />
            </div>
            <div class="li_dp_content">
              <h2>Dr. Saurabh Jain</h2>
              <h4>Consultant Physician | MBBS, DNB (Medicine), PG Diabetology (Boston), PGD Endocrinology (RCP, UK)</h4>
              <p style="font-size: 13px;">With over 15 years of experience, Dr. Saurabh Jain specializes in Internal Medicine, with special interest in Diabetes and Cardiac care. He consults at Naivaidya Healthcare and is affiliated with Breach Candy, Sir HN Reliance Foundation, Jaslok, and Cumballa Hill Hospital. A former physician with the Indian Air Force and Railways, he holds advanced certifications from Boston University and RCP, UK. He is an active member of IMA, API, ASE, and the Jain Doctors Association, and regularly contributes to medical conferences and research.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-lg-12">
          <div class="department_list_inner">
            <div class="image">
              <img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/daoju0r3c/image/upload/v1755686621/image_9_1_cwhpzb.png" class="img-fluid" alt="Dr. Zimpu Mehta Jain" />
            </div>
            <div class="li_dp_content">
              <h2>Dr. Zimpu Mehta Jain</h2>
              <h4>Consulting Obstetrician & Gynaecologist | MBBS, DGO, FCPS, DNB</h4>
              <p style="font-size: 13px;">Dr. Zimpu Mehta Jain is a highly experienced obstetrician and gynaecologist, specializing in infertility management and advanced laparoscopic surgeries. She completed her MBBS from K.J. Somaiya Medical College, followed by DGO, FCPS, and DNB from Seth G.S. Medical College & K.E.M. Hospital, Mumbai. She has undergone specialized laparoscopic training under Dr. Hafeez Rehman at Sunrise Hospital, Kochi, and has worked in the Department of Gynaecology at Tata Memorial Hospital. Dr. Jain is a life member of FOGSI, IAGE, and the Jain Doctors Association.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
</div>
<script src="../scripts/aboutus.js"></script>

</Layout>